# Documents and research material — never commit these.
# Source documents live outside the repo, in skittles/Documents/. They were
# purged from history on 2026-07-28 (STA_Feb.docx alone was 10 MB) and must not
# come back: binaries bloat the pack permanently, since every future clone pays
# for them even after a later delete.
